  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Post Coal Green Jobs Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to engage the recovery investments at the high government level to warranty the implementation of the Climate Neutral Coal and Economic Transition Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to incorporate the Post COVID recovery investments into the Climate Neutral Coal and Economic Transition Strategy. The project includes the generation of a simple job, cost-revenues, and carb&#xf3;n capture model (economic model); the recovery investment mapping that could be linked to the strategy; the high-level prioritization of the investments towards the strategy and their commitment; the structuration of a pilot implementation of the strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
